== Reward ==

<ul><li>{{:Dreadful Cap}}</li></ul>

== Walkthrough ==
''This quest begins with [[Azzar Habbib]], a Heretic located in the observation area of [[Paineel]] overlooking the newbie grounds.''

Upon completing the initial [[Azzar's Dreadful Hat]] quest, you see this:

: Azzar Habbib gasps in astonishment and says, You...you..found my hat!! This is the most I can repay you but perhaps I can reward you further for some other tasks?' 

You say, 'What other tasks?'

: Azzar Habbib says, 'I will sew you your own personal dreadful cap if you bring me the necessary components. I will need the pelt of a feared beast, some gold thread, and an imbued amber.'

These items are:

{{CheckboxList}}
* [[Bear Paw's Pelt]] (from [[The Mighty Bear Paw]] located deep in the Warrens).
* [[Gold Thread]] (bought from tailoring vendors for around 20pp).
* [[Imbued Amber]] (imbued by shamans or clerics of Cazic Thule).
{{End}}


'''Give him all three items and to receive your cap.'''

: Azzar Habbib says 'I must have all the necessary components to sew you a cap!'

: Azzar Habbib says 'I must have all the necessary components to sew you a cap!' 

: Azzar Habbib says, 'Here is your dreadful cap as I have promised.'

